                    "6 • 🔄 ROTATE ▸ 📈 TRADING = the chart + the pool on the right (🟢 ACTIVE / ✅ PASSED / 💀 BLOWN, ⤢ BIG CARDS); with ⚡ AUTO off the next account's BUY / SELL flashes — nothing happens until you press.",
